    "notes": "Standard Ava Zero evaluation through the avartha_pipecat adapter against a hosted Ava Zero agent on the Avartha Platform over WebRTC. The agent uses GLM-5.3 as its frontend, DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 at max reasoning as its backend worker, and Qwen3-ASR-1.7B for speech recognition. Agent build b680a988. Harness: tau2 2.0.0 (main at c06b07d) with the avartha_pipecat adapter of #758 at 048b940; nothing else is changed. Voice user simulator v1.1, tau2 2.0's default for voice-v1, with gpt-5.5 at low reasoning effort as the customer LLM. Regular speech complexity, seed 300, 0.2-second ticks, 2400-second call limit, the default hallucination reviewer, and no reward or agent-error reruns. One trial was scheduled for every base task (airline 50, retail 114, telecom 114), 30 calls at a time; calls that hit an infrastructure error were re-run from the start (2 in this run). The English caller personas used our own voices (TAU2_VOICE_ID_EN_*), not Sierra-managed voices.",
